WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
BUKOLA AYODELE:
Today, we're talking

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.300
about networking revolutions.

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:07.590
Big news for BigQuery and
VMware Engine and visual aids.

00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:10.050
I'm Bukola and welcome
to This Week in Cloud,

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:13.140
where we serve you the
lowest latency news.

00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:15.450
Managing and
connecting resources

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:19.650
across on-prem locations and
the Cloud can get complicated.

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:23.100
With the introduction of
Network Connectivity Center,

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:25.650
we deliver global scale
network management

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:30.510
to simplify complex networks for
your Cloud connectivity needs.

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:32.549
With a single
management experience,

00:00:32.549 --> 00:00:36.240
network connectivity center
serves as a seamless vantage

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:39.330
point to easily create,
connect, and manage

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:42.150
your on-prem and Cloud
network, leveraging

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:44.400
Google's global infrastructure.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:48.390
Google has been named a leader
in the Forrester Wave Cloud

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:52.590
data warehouse Q1 2021 report.

00:00:52.590 --> 00:00:56.910
For more than a decade, BigQuery
our petabyte scale Cloud data

00:00:56.910 --> 00:01:00.150
warehouse, has been
in a class of its own.

00:01:00.150 --> 00:01:02.010
We're excited to
share this recognition

00:01:02.010 --> 00:01:04.650
and we want to thank our
strong community of customers

00:01:04.650 --> 00:01:07.560
and partners for
voicing their opinions.

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:09.600
Are you looking to learn
more about Google Cloud

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:11.670
but prefer something
with visuals?

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:14.430
Head over to Google Cloud
Tech YouTube channel

00:01:14.430 --> 00:01:16.590
for a series of
whiteboard videos

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:18.540
that explain Cloud
tools for a tech

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:20.940
audience in about five minutes.

00:01:20.940 --> 00:01:24.720
With topics from Cloud Storage
to high performance computing,

00:01:24.720 --> 00:01:27.160
there is something for everyone.

00:01:27.160 --> 00:01:29.400
If you have VMware
workloads and you

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:30.960
want to modernize
your application

00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:33.480
to take advantage
of Cloud Services,

00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:37.440
to increase agility, and
reduce total cost of ownership,

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:41.160
then Google Cloud VMware
Engine is the service for you.

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:44.520
Learn more about its benefits,
features, and use cases

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:45.510
on the blog.

00:01:45.510 --> 00:01:49.100
And don't forget to check
out the handy cheatsheet too.

00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:51.500
If you want to read more
about these announcements

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:54.180
or see a full list,
check out the link.

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:55.550
Any thoughts or ideas?

00:01:55.550 --> 00:01:57.660
Leave us a comment or tweet us.

00:01:57.660 --> 00:01:59.770
We'll see you in the Cloud.

